@segment 11-14 Stormwind, West Elwynn & Loch Modan I
@start-level 11
@carry 61,239,1685
@done 76,39,91724
# Human Warlock 11-14, from the Human Mage route's segment 04: the bridge from Elwynn onto the shared Alliance
# path. Changed for the warlock:
#  - The warlock's Voidwalker chain replaces the other class's level 10 quests: 1685 Gakin's Summons (carried
#    in) -> 1688 Surena Caledon -> 1689 The Binding, all from Gakin the Darkbinder in the cellar of the
#    Slaughtered Lamb (Mage Quarter, Stormwind City 39.2, 85.2).
#  - The Mirror Lake water-sample step is gone; the west Elwynn loop keeps the Applejack Still, An Apple Treat
#    and the gnoll bounty.
#  - Trainer: the Slaughtered Lamb, on the first Stormwind visit. No second trainer visit is needed.
#  - Combat hints are written for a warlock: Imp until The Binding, Voidwalker after it.
# Goldshire -> Stormwind (shipment, bind, flight path, Gakin, train) -> on foot back out through Goldshire and
# east to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch (Surena Caledon) -> Hearthstone to Stormwind -> Gakin, The Binding
# (Voidwalker) -> out of the gate to the Applejack Still -> south to Westbrook Garrison (applejack, gnoll
# bounty) -> the gnoll camps at Forest's Edge -> garrison -> back into Stormwind only for the Deeprun Tram ->
# Ironforge (flight path)
# -> on foot through east Dun Morogh (Amberstill Ranch, Earthseer Farsen, Gol'Bolar Quarry, Ironband's
# Compound, North Gate Outpost: the Dwarf Shaman route's east Dun Morogh quests, which any Alliance race can
# take) and the South Gate Pass -> Loch Modan: Valley of Kings, Stonesplinter Valley, Thelsamar (flight path), north Loch (Stormpike, Silver
# Stream Mine). It ends in Thelsamar: the next segment starts with the gryphon to Ironforge.
# The Loch Modan part is the Skyborne Mage route's segment 04, unchanged (same quests, same order).
# Positions of the warlock quests are from the Questie data: Surena's house at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch
# (Elwynn Forest 71.0, 80.8), the Summoning Circle (Stormwind City 39.1, 84.4). Unverified in Forever: how many
# of the three in Surena's house come on one pull (the step is written for the worst case).
# New Forever quests from the ForeverChanges pages: 91736 Applejack Still (24.5, 58.2), 91738 An Apple Treat
# (Sergeant De Vries, Westbrook Garrison 24.0, 73.0).
# Left out: 176 WANTED: "Hogger" (elite), 123 / 147 The Collector (see the gnoll step), 1097 Elmore's Task
# and 109 Report to Gryan Stoutmantle (segment 05 picks both up), 2039 Find Bingles (needs level 12: segment
# 05 takes it in Ironforge), 314 Protecting the Herd (elite), 95217 (12 Copper Bars).
# Unverified: that Earthseer Farsen gives 96392 without the Kharanos lead-in 96408 (the step says what to do).
# Hearthstone: bound in Stormwind in this segment and used once, for the return from the Brackwell Pumpkin
# Patch. It stays bound in Stormwind.
# Carry-out: 263 (Stonesplinter Shamans and Bonesnappers, next Loch visit), 1338 Stormpike's Order
# (Stormwind, next segment).

# --- Stormwind, first visit ---
N Walk the road north-west from Goldshire into Stormwind @ Stormwind City, 63.2, 74.4 | Three minutes. Go through the Valley of Heroes and over the bridge into the Trade District
T 61 | Morgan Pestle, in the shop on the south side of the Trade District
S Stormwind @ Stormwind City, 60.5, 75.2 | Make the inn in the Trade District your home (the Gilded Rose). You hearth back here from the east of Elwynn in a little while
F Stormwind @ Stormwind City, 71.0, 72.5 | Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master, a few steps east of the inn
T 1685 | Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb: the tavern in the Mage Quarter, in the south-west of the city. Go through the back room and down the stairs
A 1688 | Gakin the Darkbinder: Surena Caledon. She is back in the east of Elwynn
TRAIN @ Stormwind City, 39.2, 85.0 | The warlock trainers (Demisette Cloyce, Ursula Deline, Sandahl) stand in the same cellar: anything you did not learn in Goldshire. Buy food and drink in the city before you leave

# --- East Elwynn: Surena Caledon ---
N Walk back out of Stormwind, through Goldshire and along the road east to the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch @ Elwynn Forest, 69.8, 78.6 | About ten minutes. Sell and repair in Goldshire as you pass. The patch is south of the road, a little south-east of the Tower of Azora. On the way finish two or three kills with Drain Soul: you need a Soul Shard for a Healthstone now and one for the Voidwalker later
C 1688 @ Elwynn Forest, 71.0, 80.8 | Surena Caledon (level 9) stands in the farmhouse with Erlan Drudgemoor (8) and Morgan the Collector (10). You only need Surena's Choker. Prepare: Imp out, full health and mana, a Healthstone in your bags, and kill any Defias walking outside near the house so nothing joins in and nobody stands in the way of a Fear. Stand outside the door at maximum range, pull Surena with Shadow Bolt and back away from the house so they come out to you; with luck only one or two come. If all three come, Fear Morgan the Collector (the strongest) at once and again each time he returns. Corruption and Curse of Agony on the other two, then Immolate and Shadow Bolt on Surena until she is down, Erlan Drudgemoor next, Morgan last. Loot the choker as soon as Surena is dead. Going wrong? Use the Healthstone, Fear whoever is hitting you and run north to the road: they give up after a short chase. Eat, drink and pull again: whoever you killed stays dead for a few minutes
H Stormwind | Hearthstone back to the inn in the Trade District (you bound it there on this visit). On cooldown? Walk the road west, about ten minutes

# --- Stormwind: The Binding ---
T 1688 | Gakin the Darkbinder, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb
A 1689 | Gakin the Darkbinder: The Binding. He gives you the Bloodstone Choker
C 1689 @ Stormwind City, 39.1, 84.4 | Go further down, to the Summoning Circle at the bottom of the cellar. Full health and mana, Imp out. Stand at the circle and use the Bloodstone Choker from your bags, then defeat the Summoned Voidwalker: Immolate, Corruption, Curse of Agony, then Shadow Bolt
T 1689 | Gakin the Darkbinder. You learn Summon Voidwalker: summon it now (it costs one Soul Shard). The Voidwalker is your pet from here on: send it in first, let it hold the enemy for a moment, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate

# --- The Applejack Still ---
A 91736 @ Elwynn Forest, 24.5, 58.2 | Leave Stormwind by the main gate, turn right (west) off the road and follow the city wall past Mirror Lake: the Applejack Still stands a little west of the lake. It wants the 4 Shiny Red Apples you bought at the Stonefield Farm. No apples? The gnolls further south drop them: come back, or skip this step and the next three
T 91736 @ Elwynn Forest, 24.5, 58.2 | Put the apples in: you get a bottle of Thunder Applejack
N Defias Rogue Wizards stand in the orchard beside Mirror Lake | They are level 9-10 and you no longer need them: walk around them

# --- Westbrook Garrison and the gnolls ---
A 91738 @ Elwynn Forest, 24.0, 73.0 | Go south to Westbrook Garrison, the guard post on the road to Westfall: Sergeant De Vries
T 91738 @ Elwynn Forest, 24.0, 73.0 | Hand him the Thunder Applejack
T 239 | Deputy Rainer, in front of the garrison
A 11 | Deputy Rainer
C 11 @ Elwynn Forest, 26.0, 85.0 | Forest's Edge, the woods south of the garrison: Riverpaw Runts and Outrunners (8-10) camp there. Collect 8 Painted Gnoll Armbands. Send the Voidwalker at one gnoll, then DoT it; Fear a second one only at the edge of a camp. Finish a few with Drain Soul to keep 3-5 Soul Shards. Stay in the northern camps: Hogger (11, elite) walks the hill at the far south end (26, 91); if you see him, move away. A gnoll may drop a Gold Pickup Schedule: it starts a quest for Goldshire that this route does not return for, so sell it or leave it
T 11 | Deputy Rainer, at the garrison

# --- Stormwind, only for the tram ---
N Walk back up the road into Stormwind | Buy food, drink and anything else you need in the city: the next real town is Thelsamar. No trainer visit is needed. Level 12 already? Then the Slaughtered Lamb is an optional stop for Health Funnel (it heals your Voidwalker) and the new ranks; otherwise you train in Ironforge next segment

# --- Tram to Ironforge and the walk to Loch Modan ---
N Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge @ Stormwind City, 66.0, 34.0 | The tram entrance is in the Dwarven District, in the north-east of Stormwind. Leave the rat quest on the far platform for the next segment: it runs the other way
F Ironforge @ Ironforge, 55.5, 47.7 | Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master in the centre of the city
# --- East Dun Morogh: Amberstill Ranch, Farsen, Gol'Bolar Quarry ---
A 95212 @ Dun Morogh, 63.1, 49.7 | Leave Ironforge by the main gate, go down the ramp and follow the road east to Amberstill Ranch (about four minutes): Rudra Amberstill. The pelts come from the leopards east of the quarry, together with the trogg quests
A 96392 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4 | Earthseer Farsen's campsite is on the hillside south of the ranch, overlooking the Gol'Bolar Quarry from the west. Dwarves are sent to him from Kharanos; whether he gives his quests without that errand is not known. If he offers nothing, press Skip on this step and on his other five steps below
C 96392 @ Dun Morogh, 64.8, 58.4 | Talk to Farsen again and ask for his far sight; watch the vision until the objective ticks
T 96392 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4
A 96390 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4 | Farsen: 10 Dark Iron Spies at Ironband's Compound, east of the quarry
A 432 | Foreman Stonebrow, at the Gol'Bolar Quarry camp, just east of Farsen's hill
A 433 | Senator Mehr Stonehallow, next to him
A 95214 @ Dun Morogh, 69.1, 54.9 | Quarrymaster Thesten, on the north side of the camp. If he offers nothing, kill troggs until one drops an Empty Powder Keg, right-click it and bring it to him first (a small extra quest)
C 432 @ Dun Morogh, 70.3, 55.9 | Rockjaw Skullthumpers (8-9) fill the quarry pit right beside the camp: kill 6. Every trogg here can drop Stolen Blasting Powder
C 433,95214,95212 @ Dun Morogh, 73.6, 55.4 | Work east out of the quarry: kill 10 Rockjaw Bonesnappers (9-10) and keep killing troggs until you have 16 Stolen Blasting Powder. The big snow leopards on the slopes east and south-east of the quarry (70-78, 50-63) drop the 6 Pristine Leopard Pelts. Troggs stand close together: send the Voidwalker at one, DoT it, and Fear the second when two come
C 96390 @ Dun Morogh, 77.5, 60.8 | Ironband's Compound, the walled yard south-east of the quarry: kill 10 Dark Iron Spies (9-10). They are stealthed around the buildings and open on you in melee: walk slowly with the Voidwalker beside you, send it at a spy the moment one appears, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate. Eat and drink to full between fights
A 96391 @ Dun Morogh, 77.5, 60.8 | One of the spies drops a Dark Iron Map: right-click it in your bags to start this quest. No map after 10 spies? Kill a few more
T 432 | Foreman Stonebrow, back at the quarry camp
T 433 | Senator Mehr Stonehallow
T 95214 @ Dun Morogh, 69.1, 54.9 | Quarrymaster Thesten. Sell and repair at the camp
T 96390 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4 | Earthseer Farsen, on the hillside west of the quarry
T 96391 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4 | Farsen. Do NOT take his next quest (Old Ironforge Incursion): it is a dungeon
T 95212 @ Dun Morogh, 63.0, 49.8 | Rudra Amberstill, at Amberstill Ranch north of Farsen's camp

# --- North Gate Outpost ---
A 419 | Follow the road east past the quarry and take the left (northern) branch to North Gate Outpost: Pilot Hammerfoot
T 419 | A Dwarven Corpse lies in the snow west of the outpost, on the slope north of the road
A 417 | From the corpse
C 417 @ Dun Morogh, 78.3, 37.8 | Mangeclaw (level 11 bear) prowls right next to the corpse. Full health and mana first: send the Voidwalker in, give it a moment to hold him, then Corruption, Curse of Agony, Immolate and Shadow Bolt. Loot the Mangy Claw
T 417 | Pilot Hammerfoot, back at North Gate Outpost
N Walk to Loch Modan @ Dun Morogh, 86.0, 51.0 | Back to the fork and take the southern branch east to South Gate Outpost, then go through the South Gate Pass tunnels

# --- Loch Modan: Valley of Kings ---
A 224 | Mountaineer Cobbleflint is at the guard tower in the Valley of Kings, just past the last tunnel
A 267 | Captain Rugelfuss, inside the tower
C 224 @ Loch Modan, 30.8, 68.2 | Stonesplinter Valley, the trogg hills east of the tower: kill 10 Stonesplinter Troggs and 10 Stonesplinter Scouts (11-12). Every trogg can drop a Trogg Stone Tooth
C 267 @ Loch Modan, 30.8, 70.0 | Finish 8 Trogg Stone Teeth on any troggs on the way back to the tower
T 224 | Mountaineer Cobbleflint, at the southern guard tower
T 267 | Captain Rugelfuss
A 237 | Mountaineer Gravelgaw, a little south of the tower
C 237 @ Loch Modan, 33.0, 76.0 | Kill 10 Stonesplinter Skullthumpers and 10 Stonesplinter Seers (13-14) in the hills further south. They are above your level: one at a time, the Voidwalker in first on the Skullthumpers, then all your DoTs; the Seers heal and a warlock cannot interrupt, so kill a Seer first and fast, or Fear it while you kill the other. Health Funnel keeps the Voidwalker up once you are 12. Too hard at 12? Do the north of the zone first and come back for this before you leave
T 237 | Mountaineer Gravelgaw
A 263 | Mountaineer Wallbang, at the tower. Keep it: the Shamans and Bonesnappers are level 15-16, for your next Loch Modan visit

# --- Thelsamar ---
A 416,1339 | Follow the road north-east to Thelsamar: Mountaineer Kadrell patrols the main street
A 418 | Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn (Stoutlager Inn). Do NOT bind here: your hearthstone stays in Stormwind
F Thelsamar | Thorgrum Borrelson, the gryphon master on the south side of town
N Grenhild Darktalon in Thelsamar offers Snowbound (a jar of snow from the South Gate Pass to the north shore). Skip it: it does not fit this loop

# --- North Loch Modan ---
C 418 @ Loch Modan, 31.5, 39.0 | On the way north kill Elder Black Bears (Bear Meat), Mountain Boars (Boar Intestines) and Forest Lurkers (Spider Ichor) beside the road: 3 of each item
T 1339 | Mountaineer Stormpike, at the top of the northern guard tower (Algaz Station), in the north-west corner of the zone
A 307,1338 | Stormpike gives both. Keep Stormpike's Order: it goes to Stormwind next segment
C 307,416 @ Loch Modan, 35.5, 24.3 | Silver Stream Mine, the kobold cave east of the tower. Open 4 Miners' League Crates inside for the Miners' Gear and cut 12 Tunnel Rat Ears from any kobold. The Geomancers cast fire: kill them first, and Fear a second kobold if two come, but only where the tunnel behind it is already cleared
T 307 | Back west to Mountaineer Stormpike
C 418 @ Loch Modan, 33.0, 31.5 | Finish the sausage meats on the walk back south to Thelsamar
T 416 | Mountaineer Kadrell, in Thelsamar
T 418 | Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn. Sell and repair: the next segment starts with the gryphon from Thelsamar to Ironforge
